  "contentHtml": "<p>#거울 #배려 #반전 #좌우반전 #앞뒤반전 #거울상<br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^<br>생각보다 과학적인 장난감과 그와중에 신중한 댓글.<br>&quot;원래 그런건가요?&quot;<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b3da0bdc9c075f424336f44d9b7e27fddb23a637\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b3da0bdc9c075f424336f44d9b7e27fddb23a637\" data-origin-width=\"252\" data-origin-height=\"475\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b79e5a67877252a05eb3adc9215c8531bbe3129a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b79e5a67877252a05eb3adc9215c8531bbe3129a\" data-origin-width=\"256\" data-origin-height=\"331\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">앞차의 거울에서 뒤에 쫓아오는 119구급대를 볼때 바로 보이고 양보해주라고 119를 거꾸로 써줌.<br>과학을 이용한 양보 압박.<br>aka &quot;핑계 방지용&quot;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86b9e51a2f020c23bb40ac3ba31183e46c556e38\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86b9e51a2f020c23bb40ac3ba31183e46c556e38\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"330\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
